{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b6a3ea3184cba8a0","name":"Stealth Field Generator","source":{"id":"source:reference-b6a3ea3184cba8a0","title":"Stealth Field Generator","revision":19350,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:47:21Z","sha256":"7f5ed0e7d8b56672ea6dc8ba15b94ff28235c6a7e4a8f542151b4e30e2fa8e23","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19350","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stealth%20Field%20Generator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b6a3ea3184cba8a0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A small and unobtrusive device worn on the belt, the Stealth Field Generator emits a sound-dampening field around the wearer that makes sneaking up on an opponent easier. Additionally, the Stealth Field Generator uses technology similar to that of a personal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Shield"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Shield"}," to bend light around the wearer, making them harder to see.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Stealth Field Generator grants ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") to the wearer when activated. Activating a Stealth Field Generator is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", and it lasts for the duration of the encounter, until the wearer takes damage, or until the wearer attacks or uses a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", whichever comes first. A Stealth Field Generator requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 5 uses, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
